    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-local metrics buffer with automatic deregistration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each thread has its own buffer to avoid contention. Background thread periodically drains all buffers. RAII wrapper ensures buffer is deregistered when thread exits. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
